# LoopLab must not make a network call from a child's browser.
#
# The zone has Cloudflare Web Analytics on automatic injection, which adds a
# static.cloudflareinsights.com beacon to every HTML response at the edge — not
# in the build, and invisible to curl, so it is easy to miss. That contradicts
# what the privacy one-pager tells school IT: no accounts, no analytics, no
# network calls after load.
#
# `no-transform` tells Cloudflare not to modify the payload, which stops the
# injection for this hostname only. heutalab.com keeps its own analytics.
# Keep max-age=0 + must-revalidate so a deploy is picked up immediately.
/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate, no-transform

# Hashed filenames, so these can be cached hard — still no-transform.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable, no-transform
